- Kentang?

00:02:30.125 --> 00:02:32.583
Aku harus mengantarnya ke polisi.
Kalian polisi, bukan?

00:02:32.666 --> 00:02:35.708
Jelas sekali.
Dia subyek sempurna.

00:02:35.791 --> 00:02:37.000
Subyek?

00:02:37.083 --> 00:02:40.541
